    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Pathoschild/SMAPI/zipball/4.5.2",
    "body": "<h1 class=\"noinclude\">\r\n\r\nSee [the SMAPI website](https://smapi.io/) for recommended download sources.\r\n\r\n</h1>\r\n\r\n**See [what's new in SMAPI 4.5](https://www.patreon.com/posts/149054246) for the main changes.**\r\n\r\nSMAPI 4.5 lets you configure SMAPI itself in-game, improves performance, adds automated and attested builds, retires the 'SMAPI for developers' edition, and adds malicious file detection.\r\n\r\nPatch releases:\r\n* 4.5.1 fixes an error installing SMAPI 4.5.0 on Linux/macOS, and updates Portuguese translations.\r\n* 4.5.2 mainly improves performance, fixes the Linux/macOS installer not saving the color scheme correctly in 4.5.0+, and updates translations for recent changes.\r\n\r\nRequires Stardew Valley 1.6.14 or later on Linux/macOS/Windows or Steam Deck.\r\n\r\n(\u26a0\ufe0f **For macOS players:** don't forget to follow the full [install guide for macOS](https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Modding:Installing_SMAPI_on_Mac) to avoid security warnings. Players on Linux or Windows can ignore this.)",
